# 默认按文本处理、由 Git 统一规范化换行（仓库内 LF，检出时按平台配置）
* text=auto

# C# / XAML / 项目文件强制 LF 入库
*.cs text
*.xaml text
*.csproj text
*.props text
*.sln text
*.json text
*.md text

# 脚本
*.ps1 text
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产——禁止任何换行处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.dat binary
*.bin binary
*.pdf binary

# 虚拟机磁盘与转储永远不会出现在仓库里，防御性排除
*.vhd binary
*.vhdx binary
*.dmp binary
